Suggests: tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-eng
Description: pdfLX - PDF editor for GNOME
 pdfLX edits text, images, shapes, and tables in PDF files, and provides
 page tools (insert, split, reorder, N-up, headers and Bates numbering,
 labels), review annotations, forms, redaction and sanitization,
 password protection, digital signatures and their verification,
 conversion from images and other document formats, optimization, and
 exports to DOCX, text, Markdown, images, and structured formats.
 .
 A command-line tool, pdflx-cli, performs the same operations in batch.
 Optional OCR uses Tesseract when it is installed.
